      "text": "Glasgow Warriors are aiming to avoid three consecutive home games without a win for the first time since December 2020 as Connacht visit Scotstoun\nFor everything you need to know 👉 shorturl.at/CzSgy",
      "author": "Scotland Rugby News",
      "handle": "scotlandrugbynews.bsky.social",
