      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:bgeqymeltxrtny34aikxe4vy/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxgmds4wbt2z",
      "text": "🔵 We're seeking applications for the position of Women’s Development Officer (Fingal)\n🏉 The successful candidate will be responsible for promoting the women's game to support increased player participation in the area\nGet more info and apply here 👉 https://bit.ly/4dtfQyK",
      "author": "Leinster Rugby",
      "handle": "leinsterrugby.bsky.social",
