      "text": "Glasgow Warriors are aiming to avoid three consecutive home games without a win for the first time since December 2020 as Connacht visit Scotstoun.\nThe Warriors boast a formidable home record under Franco Smith, but Connacht have a good recent record on the road\n🔗 shorturl.at/CzSgy",
