      "text": "🐉 𝙏𝙀𝘼𝙈 𝙉𝙀𝙒𝙎 | Friday night under the lights as we face @ospreys at 🏠 in the @URCOfficial!💥\n😮‍💨 Paea and Hope start in the backline\n👊 Beddall in at 7️⃣\n👨‍✈️ Angus set for return from bench\n🎟️ eticketing.co.uk/dragons/\n📞 01633 670690\n#WeAreGwentRugby",
