      "text": "Here's the Cardiff side to travel to Leinster this Saturday;\n- Southworth & Belcher in up front\n- Thomas returns at flanker\n- Faletau & Davies fit again\n- Grady back on the wing\n- URC debut for Young\n- Possible debut for Paea\n- Nott on to the bench\nFew changes but still strong!",
      "author": "Cardiff Rugby Life",
