      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:ouvin3vruox2v2t674dym2c5/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxecupd7cc2w",
      "text": "Some thoughts on Cardiff's attacking progression, being mentally switched on for 80 minutes, and how both will be tested by a trip to Leinster this weekend.\ncardiffrugbylife.wales/2026/10/06/v...",
